# "If you cast a spell this way, that creature enters with a finality counter on it" is a replacement effect about the spell,
# not an ability Leonardo applies while he is there (CR 614.1c): the rider follows the spell, as the rulings on Kess,
# Dissident Mage and Lier, Disciple of the Drowned say. A Mardu Scout dashed from the graveyard with Leonardo's permission
# keeps it when Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills Leonardo with the spell still on the stack: it enters with a finality counter.

